TRACKS Y 5 DO 3571 STEP 1400 LAYER METAL2 ;
TRACKS X 4 DO 8571 STEP 1400 LAYER METAL1 ;
TRACKS Y 4 DO 3571 STEP 1400 LAYER METAL1 ;
TRACKS X 3 DO 8571 STEP 1400 LAYER METAL4 ;
TRACKS Y 3 DO 3571 STEP 1400 LAYER METAL4 ;
TRACKS X 2 DO 8571 STEP 1400 LAYER METAL3 ;
TRACKS Y 2 DO 3571 STEP 1400 LAYER METAL3 ;
TRACKS X 1 DO 8571 STEP 1400 LAYER METAL2 ;
TRACKS Y 1 DO 3571 STEP 1400 LAYER METAL2 ;
TRACKS X 0 DO 8571 STEP 1400 LAYER METAL1 ;
TRACKS Y 0 DO 3571 STEP 1400 LAYER METAL1 ;

COMPONENTS 2 ;
- I_0_0 Modulation + PLACED ( 220500 1000000 ) N ;
